 the crown's enemy — a member admitting a paragon under the crown's ban (CH §11) or granting passage to a unit whose mover is at war with its liege (PS §7.7) — is PRICED as a `fealty_defied` row with the deference patch, through PL's request door (§4.6), and NEVER proposes a break: the detector reads only this tick's new treaties and coalition joins (§0's host) and never the fealty record, so no `fealty_defied` row of any occasion can open `fealty_break`.]
